    "name": "MIDNIGHT SNACK",
    "steam_appid": 3671370,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671370/extras/910ecf7e3ed60e8dde3243baab86cd46.poster.avif?t=1749841140\" width=596 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671370/extras/910ecf7e3ed60e8dde3243baab86cd46.webm?t=1749841140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671370/extras/910ecf7e3ed60e8dde3243baab86cd46.mp4?t=1749841140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MIDNIGHT SNACK</strong> is a short, first-person psychological horror game with multiple endings about waking up in the middle of the night with an empty stomach. Live through multiple nights in the apartment building, talk to the other inhabitants, evade the lurking pale husk that stalks the halls and piece together your story. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671370/extras/a9fde3f17b47aa8cd8853d8bdf5c6773.poster.avif?t=1749841140\" width=596 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671370/extras/a9fde3f17b47aa8cd8853d8bdf5c6773.webm?t=1749841140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671370/extras/a9fde3f17b47aa8cd8853d8bdf5c6773.mp4?t=1749841140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Never Ending Nightmare</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up again, stomach as empty as before. Was it just a vivid dream caused by your poor nutritional practices? Oh well, time to go get a snack for real.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671370/extras/9f69af35fde87682200eaece96c68d72.poster.avif?t=1749841140\" width=798 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671370/extras/9f69af35fde87682200eaece96c68d72.webm?t=1749841140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671370/extras/9f69af35fde87682200eaece96c68d72.mp4?t=1749841140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Something's Off...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cold draft hits you in irregular beats, the ambient sounds of the building claw at your ears, a parody of the hum you've heard in these halls for years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671370/extras/6e25885b70374ad8ef9646b1c88c94fd.poster.avif?t=1749841140\" width=596 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671370/extras/6e25885b70374ad8ef9646b1c88c94fd.webm?t=1749841140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671370/extras/6e25885b70374ad8ef9646b1c88c94fd.mp4?t=1749841140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Borrowed Time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you wake, your fate draws nearer. Use your time wisely, explore the building, find cracks in the artifice, talk to anyone you might find, but don't be too quick to trust anything or anyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671370/extras/3f50f9499f531a460b1d4e1040b3ba0e.poster.avif?t=1749841140\" width=596 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671370/extras/3f50f9499f531a460b1d4e1040b3ba0e.webm?t=1749841140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671370/extras/3f50f9499f531a460b1d4e1040b3ba0e.mp4?t=1749841140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Fate is in Your Hands</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Actions have consequences, and you are living them now. Hope that your remaining choices may alter your fate just yet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671370/extras/40a092146863aa00cc955b0326418032.poster.avif?t=1749841140\" width=596 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671370/extras/40a092146863aa00cc955b0326418032.webm?t=1749841140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671370/extras/40a092146863aa00cc955b0326418032.mp4?t=1749841140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
