eight=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671370/extras/3f50f9499f531a460b1d4e1040b3ba0e.webm?t=1749841140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671370/extras/3f50f9499f531a460b1d4e1040b3ba0e.mp4?t=1749841140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Fate is in Your Hands</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Actions have consequences, and you are living them now. Hope that your remaining choices may alter your fate just yet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671370/extras/40a092146863aa00cc955b0326418032.poster.avif?t=1749841140\" width=596 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671370/extras/40a092146863aa00cc955b0326418032.webm?t=1749841140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671370/extras/40a092146863aa00cc955b0326418032.mp4?t=1749841140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
